<title>USA: Cross Timbers gives final exchange figures.</title>
<headline>Cross Timbers gives final exchange figures.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cross Timbers Oil Co said Wednesday a final count shows 1,324,111 shares of its common stock were tendered in its offer to exchange new series A convertible preferred.</p>
<p>The offer was for up to 2,750,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>After cash payments in lieu of fractional shares, the tendered shares were exchanged for 1,138,729 shares of series A convertible preferred stock, the company said.</p>
